        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9009P, Infinity Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Infinity Door Pull is a great choice for modern homes. This twisted front door handle is 18 inches long and is available in oil rubbed bronze, satin nickel, or polished chrome finishes. The Infinity Door Handle set comes packaged with the modern pull and the mounting hardware to install it. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia Ultima I 9009P/415 Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 16-5/16\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Thickness: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia 9009P Pull is also available as a <a href=\"/products/infinity-back-to-back-pull-set-omnia-btb-9009p-415\"><b>Back to Back Mounted Pair</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
